  "result": "I fixed both problems across four files. I did not run the test suite, since the constraints for this task ruled out running commands beyond the edits.\n\n- **Override removal:** `src/server/repositories/organization-repository.ts` `updateOrg` unioned the new override set with the stored one, so switching a flag off was undone. It now uses the full set the service sends.\n- **Non-overridable flags:** `src/lib/feature-flags.ts` `isEnabled` now consults stored overrides only for flags marked `overridable`. Other flags are decided by their own rule.\n- **Rejecting enable requests:** `src/server/services/feature-flag-service.ts` `toggleFlag` previously let plan-gated, non-overridable flags (like webhooks) through. It now rejects any non-overridable flag.\n- **Early return in the action:** `src/actions/flags/toggle-flag.ts` now throws for non-overridable flags before its \"already enabled\" short-circuit, so a Growth workspace asking to enable webhooks gets an error instead of a silent success.",
